WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
If ICE can show up and bother some guys at their roofing job,

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.000
then bystanders should be able to bother ICE

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.680
at their state-sanctioned kidnapping job.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.560
It is only fair.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.280
The left's also putting pressure on small businesses.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.280
After they firebombed their stores during the summer of love,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.879
rioters are now saying, don't cooperate with ICE.

00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:21.480
You have an ICE store there.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.639
Hate to see you lose it.

